=== Text #8 ===
> You can't say it's not thoroughly deserved. Two impressive achievements by Claudio[ March]isio rightly called for a standing ovation from the[ Juventus Stadium] faithful before the match against Cagli[ari]. And Il[ Princ]ipino[ duly] collected two awards for his efforts following the pre-match warm-up.
First there was a commemorative plaque for his 300th[ Bian]coneri appearance – which came against[ Fi]orentina last week – handed to him by president Andrea Agnelli.
Then it was time for J-Member Martina[ Div]is to hand him the MVP of the[ Month] Powered By Hanwha award for April on behalf of the[ Juventus] Membership community.
A memorable night for Marchisio and an unforgettable one for Martina, who got to[ meet] one of her heroes while soaking up the pre-match atmosphere on the hall[owed] J-Stadium[ turf].
Next time you could be the lucky J-Member doing the honours! You just need to go to the ON THE PITCH > Fixtures and Results section and vote for your man of the match after every game.
If you haven't joined the[ Juventus]Membership family yet, don't delay: do it today! For more details, see here. #WeAreOne!

